	"VersionName": "1.0.0",
	"FriendlyName": "Water Placer",
	"Description": "Editor tool that reads EPSG:4326 water polygons, clips Cesium tilesets inside (or outside if inverted) those polygons, and places Unreal Water Body Lakes in the holes. Compiles for Unreal Engine 5.1 and 5.3.",
